.git

# NOTE: Dockerfile/nginx.conf/docker/ are intentionally NOT listed here —
# the Dockerfile explicitly COPYs each of them to a specific destination,
# and an ignored path can't be COPYed at all (not just excluded from a
# wildcard). They never reach /usr/share/nginx/html regardless, since that
# destination is populated by explicit per-directory COPY instructions, not
# a blanket `COPY . .` — see Dockerfile.
